              "label": "As long as you have time, we can meet.",
              "labelLanguage": "en",
              "correct": true,
              "feedback": "只要…就… presents a condition as sufficient for the stated outcome; it need not be the only way. 只有…才… presents a necessary condition: without it, the outcome does not hold, but meeting it alone is not automatically a promise of the outcome."
